{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Where did you put them?","note":"أين وضعتهم؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"You might have told me.","note":"من الممكن أن تكون قد أخبرتني."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom might not like that.","note":"قد لا يحب توم ذلك."},{"btype":"example","text":"You might not want to do that.","note":"أنتَ قد لا تُريد فِعل ذلك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom might know that we're here.","note":"من الممكن أن يعلم توم أنّنا هنا."},{"btype":"example","text":"If you do it, I might be able to help you.","note":"إذا فعلت ذلك, قد أكون قادر على مساعدتك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom is better at French than you might think.","note":"توم أفضل مما تعتقد في الفرنسية"},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri was little.","note":"كان زيري صغيرا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Mennad is little.","note":"منّاد صغير."},{"btype":"example","text":"I have little money.","note":"لدي القليل من المال."},{"btype":"example","text":"I have little money now.","note":"لدي الآن القليل من المال."},{"btype":"example","text":"We just need a little time.","note":"نحتاج فقط قليلا من الوقت."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Where did you put them?","ar":"أين وضعتهم؟"},{"t":"You might have told me.","ar":"من الممكن أن تكون قد أخبرتني."},{"t":"Tom might not like th